TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS

System Performance Requirements:
- Regulatory change detection latency: <15 minutes
- Impact assessment processing time: <2 minutes for complex changes
- Gap analysis completion: <30 seconds for typical organization
- Remediation plan generation: <1 minute for multiple gaps
- System availability: 99.9% uptime with 24/7 monitoring

Scalability Requirements:
- Concurrent organization support: 5,000+ organizations
- Regulatory source monitoring: 100+ authorities worldwide
- Change processing capacity: 1,000+ regulatory changes per day
- Historical data retention: 10+ years of regulatory change history
- Predictive model accuracy: >90% for impact assessments

Integration Capabilities:
- REST API for third-party system integration
- Real-time webhook notifications for critical changes
- Export capabilities for compliance documentation
- Integration with document management systems
- Support for existing compliance workflow tools

